  "description": "<p>Currently </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test1 -v -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Content-Type: text/turtle\"</span> -X PUT --data \"\"</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>succeeds however the empty OCFL file is missing.  It should result in a zero length file on disk. Also please note that </p>\n\n<p>`curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest</a> -v -H \"Content-Type: text/turtle\" -X POST --data \"\"`</p>\n\n<p>should behave similarly. </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>Integration test coverage should be added.</p>",
